// Pillar 5, M2 your work uniform (Day 8 or later, after your first oily job turned in; at the board or the tea corner).
// A one-line small opening. Head writer, seat W.
title: Your uniform
from: Zeke Torres
gist: Zeke told you oily jobs make your uniform grubby. Change at your wardrobe after them; a shower won't do it.
== lines
torres-zeke > you: You've got half a machine on you. Change before tea. Calder notices.   [laugh]
torres-zeke: Shower won't shift it. Wardrobe will.
